      "status": "coded",
      "rationale": "The paper claims a reusable generic CubeSat SysML formalization, not merely a TWC-specific model. Reuse is supported by UML stereotype profiles, a reusable parser/model-to-database transformation, public GPLv3 assets, workflow guidance, and an abstract early-design/nominal-operating-mode representation. Mission-agnostic architecture is supported within the CubeSat/mostly LEO preliminary-design scope, but interface-focused model and specific-mission model with reusable method only should not be coded.",
